WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.729
Stochastic parrots

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:03.180
proved Riemann apparently

00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:05.010
Scott Aaronson woke

00:00:04.822 --> 00:00:05.529
up to news

00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:06.638
that Levent Alpöge

00:00:06.485 --> 00:00:08.100
says Anthropic models

00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:09.209
proved the Generalized

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.305
Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:10.483 --> 00:00:12.829
producing 17.4 million

00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:13.513
lines of Lean

00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:13.902
code

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:15.742
Social media is

00:00:15.554 --> 00:00:16.473
now joking that

00:00:16.285 --> 00:00:17.771
the so-called stochastic

00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:18.985
parrots just proved

00:00:18.797 --> 00:00:20.164
the Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:21.226
a jab at

00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:22.511
Aaronson's own phrase

00:00:22.323 --> 00:00:23.726
from 2021

00:00:24.254 --> 00:00:25.669
Aaronson notes Lean

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.624
itself still has

00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:27.143
issues

00:00:27.202 --> 00:00:28.381
from kernel bugs

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:29.242
that once allowed

00:00:29.054 --> 00:00:30.138
proofs of zero

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:30.987
equals one to

00:00:30.799 --> 00:00:32.166
uncertain soundness

00:00:32.694 --> 00:00:33.708
Full story on

00:00:33.519 --> 00:00:34.415
the dashboard
